# linux-aether-modules.package — modules for the linux-aether kernel image.
name: linux-aether-modules
version_from: kernel/upstream.lock
recipe: packaging/PKGBUILD-aether-base (kernel case)
source: kernel/source/linux (build products only)
produces:
  - /lib/modules/<kver>/ (modules.builtin, depmod index, .ko files)
depends: [linux-aether]
note: |
  Split from the image package so kernel rollback
  (recovery/rollback/kernel_rollback.py) can retain the previous module tree
  beside the previous vmlinuz without duplicating the image payload.
